{{!--
  Repository strategy selection -- ADR output template for the "repo-strategy" decision framework (11 §11.0's own execution
  contract: "produce a ranked recommendation with the top option's own killer risk stated ...
  write an ADR"). Rendered by whichever future piece builds the real template-rendering engine
  (none exists yet anywhere in this codebase, per test/templates.test.ts's own comment: "no piece
  before the M2 engine renders a template at all" -- still true as of M6 T5) against that
  framework's own real execution data. Only Handlebars built-in helpers are used (#each, #if) --
  no custom helper is declared anywhere in this repository yet, matching TEMPLATE_INDEX's own 21
  artifact stubs' identical "no undeclared helper calls" convention (test/templates.test.ts).
  Every triple-stash {{{ }}} is deliberate: a double-stash {{ }} HTML-escapes its value by
  Handlebars' own default, which would corrupt a YAML scalar containing an apostrophe or an
  ampersand -- this is a Markdown/YAML render target, not HTML.
  Every array field's own {{#each}} carries an {{else}} branch rendering a literal "[]" -- Handlebars'
  own each helper renders nothing at all for an empty array, which would otherwise leave the YAML key
  with no value and parse as null, not an empty array; adrSchema's own array fields
  (supersedes/related/diagrams/blast_radius/deciders) reject null. A critic round confirmed this by
  actually rendering a template with empty-array data and parsing the result as YAML, not just
  parsing the Handlebars source as an AST.
--}}
---
id: ADR-{{seq}}
type: ADR
schemaVersion: 1
title: {{{title}}}
status: {{{status}}}
category: delivery
deciders:
{{#each deciders}}
  - {{{this}}}
{{else}}
  []
{{/each}}
date: {{{date}}}
created: {{{date}}}
updated: {{{date}}}
revision: 1
author: {{{author}}}
reversibility: {{{reversibility}}}
blast_radius:
{{#each blastRadius}}
  - {{{this}}}
{{else}}
  []
{{/each}}
revisit_trigger: {{{revisitTrigger}}}
supersedes:
{{#each supersedes}}
  - {{{this}}}
{{else}}
  []
{{/each}}
superseded_by: null
related:
{{#each related}}
  - {{{this}}}
{{else}}
  []
{{/each}}
diagrams:
{{#each diagrams}}
  - {{{this}}}
{{else}}
  []
{{/each}}
framework: repo-strategy
changelog:
  - revision: 1
    date: {{{date}}}
    by: {{{author}}}
    summary: {{{changelogSummary}}}
---

